{"sectionId":"equilibrium/mass-action","items":[{"id":"equilibrium--mass-action-k001","sectionId":"equilibrium/mass-action","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"가역반응에서 동적 평형은 정·역반응 속도가 같은 상태다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--mass-action-k002","sectionId":"equilibrium/mass-action","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"평형상수는 활동도를 반응 계수만큼 거듭제곱한 비로 표현한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--mass-action-k003","sectionId":"equilibrium/mass-action","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"순수 고체와 순수 액체는 활동도 1로 처리한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--mass-action-k004","sectionId":"equilibrium/mass-action","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"이상기체 근사에서 통상적인 농도·압력 표기 Kp=Kc(RT)^Δn_g를 사용할 수 있으며 엄밀한 무차원 정의에서는 표준상태를 고려한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--mass-action-k005","sectionId":"equilibrium/mass-action","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"반응을 역전하면 K의 역수, k배 하면 K^k, 반응을 합하면 K를 곱한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--mass-action-k006","sectionId":"equilibrium/mass-action","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"르샤틀리에 원리는 평형계에 가한 교란에 대한 반응 방향을 예측한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--mass-action-k007","sectionId":"equilibrium/mass-action","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"반응물 첨가, 생성물 제거는 대체로 정반응 방향으로 유도한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--mass-action-k008","sectionId":"equilibrium/mass-action","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"압축은 기체 몰수가 더 적은 방향을 선호하지만 기체 몰수 차이가 없으면 해당 효과가 없다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--mass-action-k009","sectionId":"equilibrium/mass-action","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"일정 V에서 불활성 기체 첨가는 이상기체 반응종 분압을 바꾸지 않는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--mass-action-k010","sectionId":"equilibrium/mass-action","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"온도는 K 자체를 바꾸며 흡열 정반응의 K는 온도 상승 시 증가한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--mass-action-k011","sectionId":"equilibrium/mass-action","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"van't Hoff 식 d lnK/dT=ΔH°/(RT²)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--mass-action-k012","sectionId":"equilibrium/mass-action","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"평형상태에서도 분자 수준 반응은 계속된다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"equilibrium--mass-action-k013","sectionId":"equilibrium/mass-action","unitId":"equilibrium","subject":"chemistry","text":"K는 일정 온도에서 초기 농도와 무관하다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-sco